@block libs.runner
purpose run cmake/ninja/ctest with timeouts in a clean environment
kind    leaf
thread  any
est     M
fn      run(RunOptions) -> Result<RunResult>
fn      build(BuildOptions) -> Result<BuildResult>
fn      test(TestOptions) -> Result<TestSummary>
inv     API keys and other secrets never reach child processes
inv     a process past its timeout is killed
